:Namespace Baseline
⍝ The frozen phase-2 baseline evaluator (oracle tools/src/baselines.rs, eval_phase2): discs ×100 plus a square table.
⍝ Search uses it when its table has en←#.Baseline. Never change it: matches are measured against it.
